Comment: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:22.13,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.11,0:12:29.14,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.45,0:01:38.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Gundam successfully fought off\NChallia Bull's Braw Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.96,0:01:44.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, its control system was no longer\Nable to keep up with Amuro's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:48.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro's reflexes and combat abilities\Nhad continued to improve...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:52.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...making it evident that the Gundam's\Nperformance was no longer good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.97,0:01:56.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Modifications to the Gundam's\Ndrive system began at once...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:02:00.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...but nobody could say whether\Nthat would solve the problem at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.44,0:02:12.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it good that Amuro's getting stronger?\NThen the Gundam will be stronger, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.13,0:02:15.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so dumb! The Gundam can't fight\Nunless it can keep up with Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.98,0:02:18.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's why everyone's so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:20.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go help out with dinner or something, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.79,0:02:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you talk to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.21,0:02:22.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.83,0:02:25.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They want us to go\Nto Solomon's technical headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.15,0:02:27.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do the Federation Forces have a solution?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.71,0:02:31.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine the Federation Forces\Nare that considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.13,0:02:34.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Mirai. I haven't noticed myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:37.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But have Amuro's combat skills\Nimproved that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:39.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can tell by watching his recent battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.81,0:02:42.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. No, that's not what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.02,0:02:48.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His intuition is so good...\Nisn't it like he's seeing the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:50.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.07,0:02:51.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow, you sense it sometimes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:53.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.87,0:02:55.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro is different now...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:02:58.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Having said that, I don't believe\Nwhat Ms. Matilda said in the past...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.89,0:03:02.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...about Amuro being some kind of esper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.29,0:03:05.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Human beings can't change themselves\Nso conveniently.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.01,0:03:07.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course not. Right, Fraw Bow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:07.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.79,0:03:09.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai! We're entering Solomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:09.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.27,0:03:29.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want all White Base mechanics\Nto step away from the Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:33.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll take over from this point on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:35.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry with the magnet coating!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.91,0:03:37.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:39.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:41.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Amuro Ray, the Gundam pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.99,0:03:45.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm here because I read your report.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:47.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me if this doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.33,0:03:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, we've never had\Na chance to test it properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.11,0:03:52.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:56.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm applying my theory\Nto make the Gundam move faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.34,0:03:58.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure that's possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:00.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They can't guarantee anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.21,0:04:01.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:03.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's Dr. Mosk Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:05.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A top electromagnetic engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.70,0:04:08.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's called a magnet coating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:12.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're making the Gundam's drive system\Nfaster by wrapping it in electromagnetic fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.57,0:04:15.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See? It's sort of like oiling the joints.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:18.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can they really do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:20.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can answer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:21.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll have to ask the doctor himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.93,0:04:23.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand the concept, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.98,0:04:27.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to a strategy meeting.\NWe should take off shortly. Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.72,0:04:28.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.37,0:04:30.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:32.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.72,0:04:34.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't stand this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:35.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ditto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.21,0:04:38.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get a move on!\NThe operation has already begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:43.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Challia Bull has been defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.78,0:04:46.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was likely due to his inexperience.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.50,0:04:50.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Char's reports said the Gundam\Nmay not be tuned to a Newtype's abilities...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:53.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Char. He's always guessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:53.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.90,0:04:54.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.11,0:04:57.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what of Supreme Commander\NGihren's strategies?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:05:01.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right! Our Granada fleet and A Baoa Qu\Nwill form the front line...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:03.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...with the Solar Ray at the homeland...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:08.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Solar Ray...?\NYes, that must be Gihren's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.88,0:05:21.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Granada base on the far side of the\Nmoon, and this space fortress, A Baoa Qu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.93,0:05:25.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The line linking them\Nis Zeon's final line of defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:32.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Mahal, the Principality of Zeon's\Nthird closed-cylinder colony.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:44.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Vessel 123, all set!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.27,0:05:47.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks! Go ahead and take off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:51.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You! And you call yourself a Zeon citizen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.33,0:05:54.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been separated from my granddaughter.\NI was looking for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:57.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guarantee you,\Nyour granddaughter is on one of the ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:06:00.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I won't know where her ship's headed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.05,0:06:02.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's within Zeon. You'll find her in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:03.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next group, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.22,0:06:06.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get up! It's your group's turn to go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.35,0:06:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The mandatory evacuation of Mahal's\N1.5 million residents...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...began four days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:18.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was obvious that this was part of a plan\Nto defend the homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.98,0:06:24.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Panels of solar cells used at other colonies\Nwere being brought here to Mahal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.70,0:06:29.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The residents could only watch anxiously\Nas the preparations continued.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.76,0:06:44.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Gihren...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.76,0:06:48.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trying to evacuate a million civilians\Nonly demonstrates...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:51.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...your incompetence as a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.43,0:06:55.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How dare you say that to my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.94,0:06:57.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gihren!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.01,0:07:00.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am the man who laid out\Nthis nation's monarchical system.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.29,0:07:02.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I can't support your militaristic...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:05.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear your plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:08.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For our Zeon homeland...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:11.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...the moon and A Baoa Qu\Nmark the final line of defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.13,0:07:18.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As such, the Earth Federation Forces\Ncan invade us from these three routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.91,0:07:22.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once they breach the line,\NZeon is exposed and helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:26.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So we must attack the oncoming fleet\Nwith the Solar Ray before they get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:32.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By using a colony for this system, we'll save\NZeon while also saving time and money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:36.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What will you do, Gihren,\Nafter winning at such cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:39.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd be honored if you'd sign your consent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:40.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're already started. Why ask me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.72,0:07:44.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Without Sovereign Degwin,\Nthere is no Principality of Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.78,0:07:47.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And? What are you planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.74,0:07:50.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've reduced the human population.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.17,0:07:54.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll maintain it at this level,\Nleaving only the superior races.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:57.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the only way humanity can hope\Nto achieve everlasting peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:08:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it can only be done\Nby controlling humanity...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.84,0:08:02.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...through the dictatorship of the Zabi family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:07.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gihren. Are you familiar...\Nwith Adolf Hitler?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.41,0:08:11.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hitler...? The historical figure\Nfrom the middle era?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:14.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. He was a dictator.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.67,0:08:17.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A man who failed to figure out\Nthe rest of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:20.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You seem to be following\Nin Hitler's footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:22.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.82,0:08:28.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I established the Principality\Nas a means to quickly unite the Zeon people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:31.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was to make Zeon's ideals a reality.\NBut now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:36.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This follower of Hitler\Nhas created a dictatorship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.29,0:08:37.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Together with Kycilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.83,0:08:38.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:42.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Absolute democracy will only produce\Nweakness, as with the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:46.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Humanity will end up consuming itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.05,0:08:48.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just as it's done in this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.27,0:08:50.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I will be victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.19,0:08:53.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See for yourself how Hitler's follower\Nfights this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:57.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will take command at A Baoa Qu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:04.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that Hitler was defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.03,0:09:16.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got it! One ship is a Magellan-class!\NThree Salamis-class!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.08,0:09:17.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's their minimum combat unit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.41,0:09:18.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Send out mobile suits!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:20.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Char, shall we send the Elmeth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:23.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.\NDon't give Lalah special treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:28.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lalah, you're not afraid, are you?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.17,0:09:29.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm fine, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:31.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This'll be your first actual battle.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:34.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cover the 2 Rick Doms from behind.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.05,0:09:35.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:37.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll head out shortly myself.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.18,0:09:39.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.01,0:09:46.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Any reinforcements from Granada?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:49.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gwarib will be here in 5 or 6 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.11,0:09:54.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm. It looks like Lady Kycilia\Nhas finally decided to take action...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.48,0:09:57.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,J-missile!\NTarget the enemy Magellan-class!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:02.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Minus 0.2! Adjusting 2! Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:06.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good! R 0.3! 2! Left 0. 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.38,0:10:07.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.94,0:10:17.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aim second J-missile at the target!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.97,0:10:19.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:30.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well done.\NI'll head out in the Gelgoog.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.28,0:10:32.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mulligan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.32,0:10:35.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving you in charge.\NI believe you owe me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.32,0:10:37.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be sure to do a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:38.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.37,0:10:41.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need you to give me 30 seconds\Nof covering fire after I've launched.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.65,0:10:42.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.59,0:10:50.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! 30 seconds of covering fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.63,0:10:52.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't hit our own mobile suits!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.93,0:10:59.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good job, Mulligan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.73,0:11:00.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C'mon, move it, Gelgoog!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:06.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Attack the portside Salamis!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:17.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did it, Captain! I got them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:21.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those were the Elmeth's bits?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.59,0:11:24.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She fights like a veteran pilot already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:27.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can she do that,\Nwhen she's never fought before?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:32.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll get at least one more...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:36.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Doms aren't giving me backup?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.66,0:11:41.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Doms are retreating...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:46.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are they moving behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.74,0:11:49.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're sending a first-time fighter\Nlike me to the front?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.44,0:11:51.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do I have to fight on my own?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:57.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Without support, I can't concentrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:03.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only one more, but...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.26,0:12:09.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can hear it again! It says la, la.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:10.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Source unknown!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:14.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't hit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:34.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.85,0:12:41.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Buttsham!\NYou're supposed to be in the front!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.99,0:12:48.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's crazy! With the Elmeth on our side,\Nthere's no reason for us to fight up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.97,0:12:53.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll give it a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.50,0:12:56.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah! Don't push yourself too hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.42,0:12:58.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.85,0:13:06.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I shouldn't rely\Non my own shooting skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.16,0:13:06.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.77,0:13:10.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah. I'll cover you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.23,0:13:14.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.09,0:13:16.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as you're here...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.03,0:13:18.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! There it is again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.60,0:13:23.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.14,0:13:32.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well done, Lalah!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:33.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.31,0:13:37.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for covering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.53,0:13:58.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meanwhile...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.07,0:14:00.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...at Solomon, now the forward base\Nof the Earth Federation Forces...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...orders are being given\Nfor the next operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.87,0:14:06.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This marks the beginning...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:09.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...of "Operation Star One,"\Nthe plan to invade the Zeon homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:12.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Each fleet will take its designated course...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.66,0:14:14.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...towards the target "star".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.06,0:14:33.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Though part of the 13th Autonomous Fleet,\Nwhich is meant to be at the forefront...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.77,0:14:36.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the departure of the White Base is delayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:39.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have confidence in my theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.41,0:14:42.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believe I've successfully\Neliminated all mechanical friction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:45.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So in other words, there's no limit\Nto how quickly it can move?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:50.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, in theory. However, the Gundam's\Nactual power is another matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.83,0:14:52.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.60,0:14:54.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a lifesaver, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:58.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you survive, then you can thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:15:01.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just want you to find some way\Nto send me the data...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.14,0:15:03.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...from your next battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:07.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why it's best not to know\Nwhat people are really thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.05,0:15:09.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right, Amuro Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.14,0:15:12.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll put my faith in\Nyour instincts with the Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:13.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.82,0:15:15.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Promise me you'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:16.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.51,0:15:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I can bring back your data, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.73,0:15:21.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right! Precisely!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:32.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go to full speed once we leave port.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.37,0:15:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Follow the forces ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:34.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.21,0:15:49.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Elmeth could be more powerful\Nthan your Gelgoog, Captain Char.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.75,0:15:53.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised to hear that from\Nseasoned warriors like yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:58.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We witnessed the abilities of a Newtype\Nfor the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.27,0:16:01.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With that kind of power,\NEnsign Lalah could single-handedly...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.27,0:16:04.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...wipe out an entire combat team\Nin a matter of minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.45,0:16:09.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When we became aware of this...\Nit seemed ludicrous to risk our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.95,0:16:14.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With a pilot as great as Ensign Lalah,\Nthere's no need for us common humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.37,0:16:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you perhaps envious of Lalah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.71,0:16:18.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Out of the question, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:21.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't completely rule it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.09,0:16:24.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But above all, we're truly amazed\Nby the power of a Newtype.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.25,0:16:28.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm prepared to face court-martial.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.47,0:16:33.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But all I ask is that you allow us\Nto fight behind the Elmeth when it heads out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:35.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you handle it, Ensign?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:39.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can understand the Lieutenant's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.73,0:16:43.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then it's settled.\NLieutenant, are you satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.69,0:16:45.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.03,0:16:49.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll reach the 13th Autonomous Fleet\Nin approximately 15 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:53.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right! Attention, all hands!\NEat now while you still have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.12,0:16:55.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be having combat rations\Nfrom now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.74,0:16:59.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh! So this junk isn't combat rations?\NCould've fooled me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.15,0:17:05.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.21,0:17:07.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is amazing. But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:09.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.39,0:17:09.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.51,0:17:12.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, how is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.51,0:17:17.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's great, but the faster movements\Nput an enormous strain on the parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.13,0:17:20.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's very hard to find a good balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.06,0:17:23.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.\NHave confidence, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.61,0:17:25.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.44,0:17:29.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course. You're a Newtype, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.03,0:17:32.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People usually tell me\NI'm an old-fashioned type.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:38.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sounds right. You're sentimental\Nand not at all far-out, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.60,0:17:42.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you phrase it like that\NI don't feel particularly flattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.20,0:17:53.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Char Aznable\Nand Ensign Lalah Sune, reporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.10,0:17:56.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The main forces of the carrier Dolos...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.29,0:17:59.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...have already been deployed\Non the Granada-A Baoa Qu line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.98,0:18:03.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain, you will join my raiding force\Nand take command.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:04.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.40,0:18:06.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't like that outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.27,0:18:07.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:10.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give the supply corps\Nthe Ensign's uniform size.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.36,0:18:15.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The supply corps keep insisting\Nwe don't win wars with our clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.24,0:18:19.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make them rush it in my name.\NHer clothes are an eyesore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.76,0:18:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, how was her performance test?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.21,0:18:25.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Destroyed two Salamis ships\Nin her very first combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:28.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah and the Elmeth\Nare a powerful combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.25,0:18:32.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Two ships? That's very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.13,0:18:33.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.22,0:18:36.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The time seems right for the formation\Nof a special Newtype combat force.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.35,0:18:41.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see the Elmeth in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:59.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Dr. Mosk is really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.24,0:19:00.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. It's more Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.99,0:19:01.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.27,0:19:07.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The way he pilots the Gundam...\Nperhaps Newtypes do exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:09.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Newtypes"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.59,0:19:12.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Newtypes"...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.68,0:19:17.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright! Amuro's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.64,0:19:19.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm? A fleet battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.60,0:19:24.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's our rendezvous point!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.69,0:19:26.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The main fleet\Nmust've encountered the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.85,0:19:27.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:28.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unable to confirm!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.16,0:19:33.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prepare for fleet battle!\NGundam and all other units, take off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.65,0:19:34.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy force is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:43.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We lost another ally...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.64,0:19:45.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's calling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's calling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.69,0:19:52.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.06,0:19:52.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm going for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:57.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One is Char...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.43,0:19:59.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And the other... Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.06,0:20:07.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char! I have you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.85,0:20:09.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.82,0:20:17.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?! It's getting in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.74,0:20:21.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain! Pull back, it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.70,0:20:24.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.71,0:20:30.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:32.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems completely different\Nfrom yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.05,0:20:45.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain, move aside!\NYou're in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.30,0:20:57.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gundam...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.41,0:21:02.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You hurt the Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:09.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.77,0:21:19.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.14,0:21:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain! Please eject now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.55,0:21:26.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's all right.{\i}\N{\i1}The Gelgoog won't explode from this.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.86,0:21:28.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But still...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.23,0:21:30.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm going to cling onto the Elmeth!{\i}\N{\i1}Continue your attack!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.95,0:21:33.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm continuing. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:35.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But what? What is it?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.57,0:21:40.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My head feels heavy.\NLike something is pressing down on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.53,0:21:41.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:48.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're a bad person.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:49.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.62,0:21:52.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're a bad person, bullying Char like this!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.46,0:21:58.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling bad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.40,0:22:24.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The White Base made its rendezvous with\Nthe 13th Autonomous Fleet flying ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.78,0:22:30.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, by this time, the fleet had\Nalready lost three Salamis-class ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.79,0:22:34.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Two of these were destroyed by the Elmeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.25,0:22:40.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In total, Lalah had destroyed\Nfour vessels in one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:43.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This was an unprecedented accomplishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.26,0:22:54.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if Lalah's headaches have{\i}\N{\i1}something to do with the Gundam pilot...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.44,0:22:57.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...that could definitely complicate matters.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.15,0:23:03.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And now, the battlefield shifts\Ntoward the far side of the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.23,0:23:19.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The fierce battle between\Nthe Gundam and the Elmeth...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.64,0:23:24.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...shows Amuro and Lalah a vision of\Nthe destiny toward which they must move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.67,0:23:29.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the battlefield engulfs them,\Nthen spreads to enormous proportions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.85,0:23:32.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lalah will perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.63,0:23:36.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NA Cosmic Glow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.00,0:23:40.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
